## DocumentSearch API

@DocumentSearch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5089

### Get folder tree
GET {{DocumentSearch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/folders

### Search documents
GET {{DocumentSearch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search?q=contract&includeSubfolders=true

### Upload document
POST {{DocumentSearch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folderId"

{{folderId}}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"

Sample document text for search testing.
--boundary--

### Backfill from directory
POST {{DocumentSearch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/backfill?sourceDirectory=C:\Temp\Docs
